sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    actor A as Operations Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant P as PaymentService
    participant R as PaymentRepository
    participant Q as DummyQrisAdapter
    C->>UI: Buka tagihan pickup, servis, atau marketplace
    UI->>P: createPayment(sourceId, amount, qris)
    P->>P: Validasi satu sumber transaksi dan nominal
    P->>R: Simpan payment pending
    R-->>P: paymentCode
    P->>Q: createPayment(paymentCode, amount)
    Q-->>P: QR Dummy QRIS
    P-->>UI: Tampilkan QR dan kode
    C->>UI: Selesaikan pembayaran
    UI->>P: confirmDummyQris(paymentCode)
    P->>Q: checkPayment(paymentCode)
    alt Berhasil
        Q-->>P: Reference paid
        P->>R: Ubah status menjadi paid
        P-->>UI: Pembayaran tercatat
    else Gagal
        Q-->>P: Failed
        P->>R: Ubah status menjadi failed
        P-->>UI: Pembayaran belum berhasil
    end
    opt Penjualan atau servis offline
        A->>UI: Catat penerimaan tunai
        UI->>P: recordCash(bookingId, amount)
        P->>R: Simpan payment cash paid
        P-->>UI: Bukti kas tercatat
    end
